    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "F2D94A14D3A25ADD",
      "text": "Monsieur Cyano m’a conté les exploits que vous\\navez accomplis, m[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0B07)]onsieurademoiselle [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0B07"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "F2D94914D3A2592A",
      "text": "Il m’a dit que vous aviez atteint la tête de votre\\nclub, et que vos prouesses ont même dépassé\\r\\nle cadre scolaire.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "F2D94814D3A25777",
      "text": "Vous faites la fierté de notre académie.\\nC’est un honneur d’être votre proviseur.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "F2D94714D3A255C4",
      "text": "Alors, comment se déroule votre séjour\\nà l’Institut Myrtille ?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "1BE69E4EC3A02AE9",
      "text": "Je m’amuse bien !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "1BE69B4EC3A025D0",
      "text": "Euh...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "F2D94614D3A25411",
      "text": "Votre enthousiasme me fait chaud au cœur !\\nJe suis ravi que vous ayez accepté de venir ici.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp01_04b",
      "hash64": "498688639CD57F69",
      "text": "Je crois déceler une certaine gêne...\\c\\nSi quelque chose ne va pas, n’hésitez pas\\nà rentrer à Paldea.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "F2D94514D3A2525E",
      "text": "Je vais demeurer ici quelque temps en tant\\nqu’intervenant spécial.\\r\\nContactez-moi si vous avez besoin d’aide.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "4C0E082E1AF37DEA",
      "text": "Dites-moi, m[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0B07)]onsieurademoiselle [VAR 0x0100(0000)]...\\c\\nAvez-vous déjà éprouvé de l’embarras au sein\\nde l’institut ?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0B07"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "4C0E092E1AF37F9D",
      "text": "Permettez-moi de clarifier ma question...\\c\\nMonsieur Cyano ne vous épuise-t-il pas avec\\nses exigences et ses requêtes invraisemblables ?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "66926F384EBEA96C",
      "text": "Non, ça va !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "669272384EBEAE85",
      "text": "Il est plutôt sympathique !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "4C0E062E1AF37A84",
      "text": "Je vois...\\nCela me rassure.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "4C0E072E1AF37C37",
      "text": "Monsieur Cyano et moi-même avons fait\\nnos études ensemble, voyez-vous.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "4C0E042E1AF3771E",
      "text": "À l’époque, il avait déjà une grande influence\\nsur moi.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "4C0E052E1AF378D1",
      "text": "D’aucuns auraient pensé que cela s’atténuerait\\navec l’âge, mais que nenni.\\c\\nPar exemple, écoutez ce qu’il m’a dit lorsque\\nj’allais être nommé proviseur de l’académie.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 168,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "4C0E022E1AF373B8",
      "text": "« Clav ! Tu manques de charisme ! Si tu veux\\nqu’on te prenne au sérieux, accroche des Honor\\r\\nBalls sur tes hanches ! »[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "4C0E032E1AF3756B",
      "text": "Le comble, voyez-vous, c’est que j’ai suivi\\nce conseil, aussi farfelu soit-il...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp02_08",
      "hash64": "4C0E002E1AF37052",
      "text": "Bref, n’hésitez pas à me contacter si vous avez\\nbesoin de moi.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "768BFE22D18ABD3B",
      "text": "Je dois avouer que cet échange scolaire\\nà l’Institut Myrtille est une véritable aubaine ![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "768BFD22D18ABB88",
      "text": "Cela me donne l’occasion de venir ici\\nplus souvent.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "768C0022D18AC0A1",
      "text": "Il est fort utile d’étudier le fonctionnement\\ndes autres établissements scolaires.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "768BFF22D18ABEEE",
      "text": "D’ailleurs, j’aimerais entendre votre avis sur\\ncette école. Je souhaite m’inspirer de ses atouts.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "768C0222D18AC407",
      "text": "Pouvez-vous me dire ce que vous appréciez\\nle plus à l’Institut Myrtille ?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "E4D2E8E3718A8F77",
      "text": "La façon d’enseigner !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "E4D2E9E3718A912A",
      "text": "L’emplacement de l’institut !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_select_03",
      "hash64": "E4D2EAE3718A92DD",
      "text": "Les installations de l’institut !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_select_04",
      "hash64": "E4D2E3E3718A86F8",
      "text": "Monsieur Cyano !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "768C0122D18AC254",
      "text": "Hmmm, je comprends...\\c\\nVous semblez apprécier la liberté donnée aux\\nélèves et l’importance accordée aux combats.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_teacher_head_sp03_05b",
      "hash64": "FAA8242A0EC801C2",
      "text": "Hmmm, je comprends...\\c\\nEffectivement, un établissement bâti dans\\nl’océan offre un panorama exceptionnel.\\c\\nNéanmoins, pour imiter cela, nous aurions besoin\\nde déménager l’académie tout entière...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
